      "value": "[\n  \"Capabilities: add Film & video production? She has made 11+ short films (2010-2022, shown at Lehmann Maupin and galleries), directed commercials for Apple and Hermes, and her debut feature DreamQuil premiered at SXSW 2026. Film is a core part of her practice alongside Photography and Art practice.\"\n]\n",
